# Marlin Bed Leveling Rules
- Never move Z without a known-good offset.
- Always identify leveling type (UBL/Bilinear/Manual) and setup first.
- Build mesh using UBL phase workflow (G29 P0/P1/P3). Use M421 edits without LCD.
- Validate meshes using G26 test prints.
- Remember EEPROM (M500) and slot management. Never use M502 without approval.
- Startup G-code must have G29 L0 + G29 J or M420 S1 to load mesh.
